   <|"Data" -> ".md\nSupported types: `info`, `warning`, `tip`, `todo`, while \
any other combination will be styled as `info`.\n\n### TODO list\nThere is a \
special type of admonition, which also adds a live counter to the right-top \
corner of the notebook\n\n:::todo\n\n- [ ] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n:::", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
